# Only the bundle, the webview build, notices, translations, README and licence go into the
# .vsix. vsce gives negations priority, so list exactly what to keep.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/assets/**
!dist/webview/.vite/manifest.json
!dist/webview/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!l10n/**
!package.nls.json
!package.nls.fr.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
